  "description": "Skwad up. The Skwad 1 is our fan-favorite Skwad E-bike re-upped with a few tweaks to keep it \"current\", if you will. Electric bike puns aside, the Skwad 1 is the powerhouse of our E-lineup with a 750W motor, aluminum frame, 100mm travel suspension fork and a big, comfy seat. On the bottom side, you get 6-spoke alloy wheels with 20 X 4\" tires for the perfect combination of traction, cushion and shock-absorbing qualities. Five pedal assist levels, with a thumb-throttle and 7-speeds on the drive train get you where you want to go, in style.",
